OL,3,ANorway mourns King Harald as Haakon
OL,4,AVIII ascends throne
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwegians, politicians and royals are
OL,7,Fgrieving the death of beloved King
OL,8,FHarald V, as a period of national
OL,9,Fmourning begins and his son King Haakon
OL,10,FVIII assumes the throne.
OL,12,FAfter Harald's death was announced
OL,13,Fearly on Friday, crowds amassed at the
OL,14,Froyal palace in Oslo, laying flowers
OL,15,Fand flags, some mourners visibly in
OL,16,Ftears.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
