OL,3,ANorway mourns King Harald as Haakon
OL,4,AVIII ascends throne
OL,5,
OL,6,FHours later, the new king met
OL,7,Fgovernment ministers for an
OL,8,Fextraordinary council of state meeting,
OL,9,Fafter which the 53-year-old announced
OL,10,Fhe was taking on the royal family's
OL,11,Fmotto "All for Norway".
OL,13,FHarald died peacefully in hospital at
OL,14,F06:35 local time (04:35 GMT) aged 89,
OL,15,Fafter receiving treatment there for a
OL,16,Frare blood condition since last week.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
